        "text": "The same-variant rule matters: all anchors above refer either directly to BLS Table A-1 real average hourly earnings for all employees on private nonfarm payrolls, seasonally adjusted, or to its BLS-published nominal AHE and CPI-U inputs. I am not using FRED or local catalog estimates as evidence."
